<title>USA: Technology Service names Gary Bernstein CFO.</title>
<headline>Technology Service names Gary Bernstein CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Service Solutions said on Monday Gary Bernstein has been appointed chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Previously, Bernstein was director of accounting at International Business Machines Corp's IBM North America, said the company, which is owned by IBM and Eastman Kodak Co.</p>
<p>The former chief financial officer was Burke Veley, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  212-859-1610</p>
</text>
